<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Just How You Are</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Leon Thomas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Just How You Are</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7KO0PWYRvoQMNdOZ4KHulW</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.400" end="00:09.140">Sha-ah-oh-oh (oh, baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.140" end="00:12.700">Sha-ah-oh-oh (oh, baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.700" end="00:14.200">Sha-ah-oh-oh (ah-da-da-da-da-da-da)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.970" end="00:19.960">Sha-ah, oh, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.960" end="00:22.870">I left my AmEx at the bar last night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.870" end="00:26.670">Don't know how I called a car</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.670" end="00:30.930">I must've stumbled at and landed in your place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.930" end="00:34.510">I guess it wasn't too far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.510" end="00:38.730">I always find the opportunity for mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.730" end="00:42.700">That hit me hard the next day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.700" end="00:47.220">When you pull up the memory and erase</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.220" end="00:51.030">'Cause that's just how you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.030" end="00:54.540">Wrote all these songs about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.540" end="00:58.040">And you never even said a word</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.040" end="01:00.810">Not even just a single word</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.810" end="01:08.360">I guess "congrats" is your least favorite word</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.360" end="01:12.390">And if you know you had my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.390" end="01:16.160">Could never finish what you started</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.160" end="01:19.890">You love to pick my world apart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.890" end="01:24.370">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.370" end="01:28.250">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.250" end="01:31.980">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.980" end="01:37.440">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.440" end="01:41.420">Nobu Atlantis in Dubai</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.420" end="01:45.420">You've been there more than a few times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.420" end="01:47.880">Arousing my suspicion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.880" end="01:53.270">At least you live a life worth living (a life worth living)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.270" end="01:54.840">Still young</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.840" end="01:56.340">Never made bad decisions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.960" end="01:57.460">Ain't nobody trippin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.250" end="02:00.540">Maybe them other niggas playing victim, mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.540" end="02:03.000">And this ain't my first rodeo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.000" end="02:05.860">I was fuckin' vixens way before the fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.860" end="02:09.310">Giving models X before Tesla came (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.310" end="02:11.980">Wrote all these songs about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.980" end="02:16.640">And you never even said a word</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.640" end="02:19.280">Not even just a single word</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.280" end="02:25.910">I guess "congrats" is your least favorite word (my world)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.910" end="02:30.240">And if you know you have my heart (oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.240" end="02:34.130">Could never finish what you started</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.130" end="02:38.120">You love to pick my world apart (my world)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.120" end="02:42.470">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.470" end="02:46.260">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.260" end="02:50.250">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.250" end="02:55.010">But that's just how you are, are, are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.010" end="02:59.010" /></div></body></tt>